      "title": { "en": "Rok, lata, lat" },
      "body": { "en": "The word for \"years\" depends on the number. 1 takes rok: on ma rok. 2, 3 and 4 take lata: trzy lata. From 5 to 20 it is lat, and that includes 12, 13 and 14: pięć lat, dwanaście lat." }
